WEBVTT

00:06:27.796 --> 00:06:30.556
Because we know that we live
in a deeply flawed world.

00:06:30.596 --> 00:06:32.916
And we have this stubborn conviction

00:06:32.956 --> 00:06:35.716
that we come from a perfect
and beautiful one

00:06:35.756 --> 00:06:38.076
that remains forever out of reach.

00:06:39.316 --> 00:06:41.796
And maybe that sounds depressing to you,

00:06:41.836 --> 00:06:44.756
but this state of mind,

00:06:44.796 --> 00:06:46.036
this longing,

00:06:46.076 --> 00:06:47.516
is actually the deep source

00:06:47.556 --> 00:06:50.676
of all our moonshots and our loves.

00:06:50.716 --> 00:06:52.196
It's because of longing

00:06:52.196 --> 00:06:53.796
that we play "Moonlight Sonatas"

00:06:53.836 --> 00:06:55.556
and build rockets to Mars.

00:06:55.596 --> 00:06:59.156
And it's because we're all in this
same strange state of exile

00:06:59.156 --> 00:07:03.436
that we have the capacity to empathize
with each other in the first place.